@host = http://localhost:8080

### List sales
GET {{host}}/api/Sales?_page=1&_size=10&_order=saleDate desc
Accept: application/json

### Create sale (10% discount: qty 5)
POST {{host}}/api/Sales
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "saleDate": "2026-06-01T12:00:00Z",
  "customerId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "customerName": "John Doe",
  "branchId": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222",
  "branchName": "Downtown",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333",
      "productName": "Keyboard",
      "quantity": 5,
      "unitPrice": 100.00
    }
  ]
}

### Get sale by id
@saleId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
GET {{host}}/api/Sales/{{saleId}}
Accept: application/json

### Cancel sale
POST {{host}}/api/Sales/{{saleId}}/cancel
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Health check
GET {{host}}/health
Accept: application/json
